    MAIA_POSTGRES_DSN = '<unset>'
    psycopg importable: False
    VERDICT: langgraph_agent builds the API graph on SqliteSaver (and a
             module-level MemorySaver for streaming). AsyncPostgresSaver
             exists in persistence.py but psycopg is absent from the image,
             so Postgres cannot own state here. A HITL pending action is
             therefore only visible to the replica holding that SQLite file.

