## How to keep this honest
A finding here is a statement about requirements.api.txt, so the durable
control is a dependency contract test, not this script. The next step of
WAVE 3 is a test that asserts each capability the product claims is either
importable from requirements.api.txt or explicitly declared dormant, so a
capability cannot silently disappear from the image.

Re-run after ANY change to requirements.api.txt, Dockerfile.api, or the
import sites named in the report.
